Error [E0421]: `uninit` needs a type annotation
  --> tests/ui/uninit_no_type.jet:5:10
    |
  5 |     x := uninit
    |          ^^^^^^
 Why: an uninitialized binding has no value to infer its type from, so the type must be written
 Fix: write `x: <Type> := uninit`, e.g. `buffer: [4096]U8 := uninit`
